Hi Mark

Simple/OF-Audio card are using same DT properties, but not using
same functions for it.
Now, simple-card is only supporting "widgets" feature.
I hope it will be supported on simple-scu/of-audio/of-audio-scu card too
(I'm not widgets user, thus, I can't test).
Then, DT properties needs to be shared with all Simple/OF-Audio cards.
This means if needs common function on simple-card-utils.

Currently only 1 user exist, thus, this is a little bit aggressive,
but encapsulation is one of simple card util's purpose.
This patches adds common widgets function on utils, and use it from simple-card.

Kuninori Morimoto (2):
  ASoC: simple-card-utils: add asoc_simple_card_of_parse_widgets()
  ASoC: simple-card: use asoc_simple_card_of_parse_widgets()

